# 公开仓库采用允许清单，其余文件默认留在本地。
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/docs/
!/.github/
!/px4_rtl_land_validation/

/docs/*
!/docs/标准四旋翼验证.md
!/docs/协作与资料交接.md
!/docs/仓库阅读指南.md
!/docs/实验复现说明.md

/.github/*
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/团队反馈.md

/px4_rtl_land_validation/*
!/px4_rtl_land_validation/validate.py
!/px4_rtl_land_validation/analyze.py

# 原始文档、CAD、气动工程、日志及本地环境继续排除。
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/PX4-Autopilot/
**/private_review/
**/logs/
**/parameters/
**/manual_session/
*.doc
*.docx
*.pdf
*.step
*.STEP
*.stp
*.sldasm
*.sldprt
*.sim
*.ulg
*.bson
*.tlog
*.zip
*.mp4
*.webm
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
